      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，她得知目白阿尔丹抱着\n赌上性命的决心挑战“日本德比”，\n想透过那场胜利留下活过的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b38af2e850673284ee3f9fd84208a5801499d4369154ffa30c8005e5cb779b20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
