    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d399e41d505ddcb8c8603d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌认为只要不断逼迫自己，\n或许就能获得“执着”。\n她每天从早到晚都持续投入训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82eb353d8f9609efce50957b417c05c6fe1d4843e622162dfd490c90290cd73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2cc88d2cc0ab0750be2cf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9f567218e605df08a54d68d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员觉得这不是个好倾向，\n想稍微转移她的注意力，\n于是约她一起去看“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b7e8198fa856b304fce538aea19823273a2e51d649159d1bbb0b09ecb9bd7c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d76e7d27eec0c6aa6cfd2d81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bce343a2b53d12e8f76ecd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽和玉藻十字的正面对决，\n让“天皇赏（秋）”的会场为之沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8fe7d9c477213ec287fb6afc7272764173d16c715096396562439368ddb86df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18b15c9d776d24d495d2ba21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8d1ecf8500ee6748ddc6eac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛的过程中，\n八重无敌发现小栗帽对玉藻十字\n展现出“执着”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06671737ad3d85e031baedc1d61e415e2be7a5ded737ba33f950b3f702eaafe2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f166f68ad5488ea1efdfac49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e31c9aef5457f76b43b6ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就连平常泰然自若的小栗帽都拥有“执着”。\n八重无敌苦恼着为何自己无法达到相同境界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2515aeec3a94c0e119e0b893377bf0da187d88ce62b7d2329f90b589ac8f3482",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b29ce83f7a61d33abfe67db4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "引导他人谓之智",
      "source_fingerprint": "5851ca7571d455a4b3408728bbbd9ff7aa5aa7794f6ea1763cb2cfe13c82b09f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0981dd798547c98000c3301",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌表示如果想竭尽全力，\n就必须先面对自己。\n因此她和训练员一同前往修行之地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f046a6e9e2ea20b9abac412997be8dd7bcbe7ec081dd6fe3f0f0a7d31cfd65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:506fabcef8f467b17fe4aada",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌进行冥想，\n探究自己为何总是无法压抑感情，\n做出粗暴的行为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "613c31b61c9867aad33a4161cb0098c57ff9f031bc7263d65af7d5ccc6505e0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4232aea9d1ae530f6ff0f28b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后她判断，自己激情的本质\n是源于强烈的“自我表现欲”，\n就连现在也仍在为了表现自己而奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de1eab024aae3bffcffad36cc5d7b6b8057a6d854c842bedc3b0e601c4dc6c95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a542358f06a8e966cbed4821",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她觉得只想表现自己是件丑恶的事情，\n但训练员开导她赛马娘的竞赛本就如此，\n靠实力让别人对自己俯首称臣并没有错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f162682dc6ac14dcd28db514029a0365a734ecf1dcf57222e6ce9e06f58292c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cef8f9dde4b8115ce54a2e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌决定试着解放斗争心奔跑。\n她相信即使表露出激情，\n劲敌们也不会讨厌自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eedbbbb853ade3ad8554331cc43a59f8ca567865d7a0d8b9c1b130242c55b8af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb227539a902f9b629c9415",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "克己复礼即为仁",
      "source_fingerprint": "5298e3e236d5cf33e691cfbe5fed84ca7a5a40c5a13d18baef031b7bd736185f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e23da0cbadc4fb773efda8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1924d1c1725ffcb0c8954195",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天开始展开夏季集训。\n八重无敌向樱花千代王和\n目白阿尔丹询问伤势详情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d024e0f80910fc815972493b34b5a7f317ea2c1c177bb2ec4d52b0f965b2219",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66b0526154ec4136a740cf9",
      "kind": "story",
