    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71a45ab0a5982225688ff32d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“每日杯”几天前，八重无敌\n问训练员正式上场时该警戒哪些对手。\n训练员的回答是小栗帽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b615b47365d0af8bc108d14bf79163596afecb3ae57b8ffb5b50ae4488fdbb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072408.json",
      "json_path": [
