      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0b08923af6589897fec356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽是来自笠松的赛马娘。\n她的实力获得高度评价，\n已经广受各界瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08982c61d515a7d984df2c146e83a560365192ce2324b8b5c6c5e1ebaf8f207a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44222d43d42ac98470f79c35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“每日杯”当天，八重无敌并未从\n小栗帽身上感觉到明显的压力，\n这让她觉得不太对劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d2d584dce174c85703e4647ac1d7429a44bdd9e27053521707fcd1eef8b7fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072408.json",
      "json_path": [
