    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e78c4cc323bcbf9b7e36f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”即将开始，\n八重无敌回想起过去的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73463f69916be257e482fa6804280c0b09ae19ac2f4a79ef4adee308579449e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
