    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b72f2f4f991b56c2b63f076",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年幼的八重无敌只要一激动起来，\n就会想靠力量解决问题。\n她一直难以控制这股冲动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83032ccf9e5a9b1e0cf67b22050b2cc8002a1446b7c8347e53cbd93e10a7ca07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
