      "uid": "zhcn:99fe8e0c245baee147739dcf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王也会参加“皋月赏”。\n经典三冠的第一战，即将开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a91a4643a951258787bc2501c367926a4088fc8ddf0711cefa472aafdd9ab80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
